---
description: Shared ZenABM GTM hackathon rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` before editing. Treat `context/` as read-only reference material. Build new code in `src/`, put sanitized examples in `fixtures/`, and test new behavior in `tests/`.

Never commit credentials, customer data, raw provider responses, or generated reports. Local work must use fixtures. Live provider calls are limited to a Codespace with dedicated hackathon credentials.

Create drafts only. Do not implement automatic email or LinkedIn-message sending. Every insight needs source evidence, and missing data must remain unknown rather than becoming zero.
